{
 "_about": "Logos GameCove shows for handheld makers, chip makers, stores and launchers, used only to identify them (nominative use, as Heroic, Lutris and Playnite do for store logos). Single-colour SVGs come unmodified from Simple Icons (CC0 data; the marks stay their owners'); the UI tints them at render time. Entries without a file show the system's own installed icon (stores/launchers) or plain text. Read by app/scripts/device/brand.gd.",
 "_removal": "Kill switch: set a brand's \"enabled\" to false and GameCove shows its name as text everywhere (no bundled logo, no system icon). Delete the SVG in the same commit. See docs/BRANDS.md, Logo removal requests.",
 "version": 2,
 "checked": "2026-11-09",
 "simple_icons_version": "16.37.0",
 "general_notice": "Product and company names are trademarks of their respective owners; GameCove is not affiliated with or endorsed by them.",
 "display_rules": {
  "unmodified": "Show logos as shipped: no cropping, stretching, effects or combining with other marks. Single-colour (mono) logos may be tinted one flat colour to fit the theme; multi-colour logos are shown as they are.",
  "meaning": "Only to say which device, chip, store or launcher something is. Never as GameCove's own branding or to suggest endorsement.",
  "prominence": "Smaller and less prominent than GameCove's own logo.",
  "fallback": "When logo_for() returns \"\", show the name as plain text."
 },
